    <note type="Try It" number="3.93">
      <p>Multiply:</p>
      <list type="ol" style="1">
        <item>ⓐ $$\ -6 \cdot 8\quad$$</item>
        <item>ⓑ $$\ -4(-7)\quad$$</item>
